{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t政府再上調全年經濟增長預測，由之前的3.5%至4.5%，向上修訂至4.8％，指考慮到今年首三季的實際數字，以及第四季經濟有望進一步穩健增長，預期全年經濟應該有比較強勁的增長。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:40:40.206351+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:20:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T00:30:37.885202+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:34:12.234889+00:00","content_hash":"4ea261c822a3431b7678b366c0a76cf98b5403ed31898293c14ef42020ee7006","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}